sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Webcam<br/>(browser)
    participant SM as State Machine<br/>(WASM / JS)
    participant EA as Edge Agent<br/>(Python / Angular)
    participant ES as evnt-service<br/>:8083
    participant GS as gest-service<br/>:8082
    participant CG as Caregiver UI<br/>(Angular polling)

    W->>SM: frame (~30 fps)
    SM->>SM: EAR < 0.20 → IN_BLINK1
    SM->>SM: EAR ≥ 0.27, frames ≥ 3 → WAITING_OPEN1
    SM->>SM: open frames ≥ 3 → WAITING_BLINK2
    SM->>SM: second blink confirmed → DONE
    SM->>EA: onGesture("tg-piscar-duplo-001")

    EA->>ES: POST /api/v1/reports {reportId, gestureType, profileVersion}
    ES->>GS: GET /gest-service/validation {profileVersion, tipoGestoIds}
    GS-->>ES: 200 valid
    ES->>ES: Create Evento + NotificationDispatch (atomic)
    ES-->>EA: 201 {eventoId, tier: FULL_SCREEN_ALARM, createdAt}

    loop every 5 s
        CG->>ES: GET /api/v1/events/active
        ES-->>CG: {activeEvent: {id, urgencia, comandoRef}}
    end

    CG->>CG: Render full-screen alarm overlay
    CG->>ES: POST /api/v1/events/{id}/confirmation {verdict: "real"}
    ES-->>CG: 200 confirmed
